data: {"items":["Original + 2 copies of the complaint (total 3 sets)","Affidavit in support of complaint (format per local rules)","Copy of invoice / receipt / bill (Invoice No. EM-2026-00045178)","Copy of all correspondence with Opposite Party (emails, letters)","Copy of product/service warranty card (if applicable)","Photographs / videos of defective product (if applicable)","Court fee (as per state Consumer Commission rules — typically Rs. 100-500)","Proof of payment (bank statement / credit card statement)","ID proof of Complainant (Aadhaar/PAN)","Vakalatnama (if filing through advocate)"]}

